.\" sage-box(1) manpage — mdoc format
.\" Version 0.1.0
.Dd October 14, 2026
.Dt SAGE-BOX 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sage-box
.Nd make a Mac a Sage.is box over SSH, from one file
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar box
.Op Fl -apply
.Op Fl -reboot
.Nm
.Ar box
.Cm update | status
.Nm
.Ar box
.Cm backup
.Op Fl -nightly
.Nm
.Cm local
.Nm
.Cm version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A box is a Mac that runs Sage.is apps for a team.
.Nm
reads one file per box,
.Pa ~/.sage-is/boxes/<box>.env ,
reaches the box over SSH, prints what it found and what it would change, and
changes nothing. With
.Fl -apply
it runs the plan. Every step is idempotent: a second run finds everything in
place and prints
.Dq Nothing to change .
.Pp
The box file holds the box's address and login, the names of the vault items
that unlock it, and what it runs. Secrets are
.Li bw:
references;
.Xr sage-secret 1
resolves them into the environment for the run, and they reach the box on
stdin, never on a command line and never on a disk here. The file names a host
and a login, so it stays out of every repository; the formula installs an
example as
.Pa share/sage-box/boxes/example.env .
.Sh STEPS
.Bl -tag -width "registry"
.It tools
.Li brew tap
and
.Li brew trust
the Sage.is and krunkit taps; install
.Nm sage-runtime ,
.Nm trellis-crm
and, when
.Ev BOX_AI_UI
is 1,
.Nm ai-ui .
A box without Homebrew gets its signed package first.
.It runtime
A new Colima VM (krunkit on Apple Silicon) when there is none;
.Li sage-runtime convert --yes
when the VM is vz. The dry run says so first.
.It leftovers
What Docker Desktop left behind, as
.Li sage-runtime status
lists it: dangling plugin links, a
.Pa /var/run/docker.sock
that leads nowhere, a missing buildx. What the tool cannot mend it prints.
.It power
.Li pmset -a sleep 0 autorestart 1 ,
and the LaunchDaemon from
.Li trellis-crm boot --print ,
so Colima starts at power-on with nobody signed in.
.It key, checkout
Source mode only: the read-only deploy key from the vault at
.Pa ~/.ssh/trellis-deploy ,
and a clone of Sage-is/trellis at
.Ev BOX_CHECKOUT .
A refused clone prints the one
.Li gh api
line an admin runs to register the key.
.It registry
.Li docker login ghcr.io
with the token on stdin; the Trellis image is a private package.
.It trellis
.Li trellis-crm start
with the profile, URL and port from the file, from the checkout in source
mode or the image alone in image mode;
.Ev BOX_REVIEW_AT
and
.Ev BOX_SHIFT_END
go into the settings file first. Then
.Li ai-ui start
when the box runs AI-UI.
.It backups
A LaunchDaemon on the box runs
.Li trellis-crm backup
nightly at 02:00.
.It verify
Both apps answer their health checks. When the box runs AI-UI,
.Li sage-ai
must also be on
.Li sage-network .
With
.Fl -reboot ,
the box restarts and the checks run again.
.El
.Pp
.Cm peer
mode runs the first four steps and no Trellis: a developer's Mac.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "backup --nightly"
.It Cm update
.Li brew upgrade
our tools; in source mode
.Li git pull --ff-only
in the checkout;
.Li trellis-crm update ;
.Li ai-ui start
when the box runs AI-UI, then
.Li sage-ai
joins
.Li sage-network
again; then verify.
The first step that fails stops the run.
.It Cm backup
Pull the box's newest backup archive, encrypt it with
.Xr age 1
to
.Ev BOX_BACKUP_TO ,
store it in
.Ev BOX_BACKUP_DIR
and keep the last 14. The private half of the age key lives in the vault.
.It Cm backup Fl -nightly
Install a launchd agent on this Mac that runs
.Cm backup
at 03:30, after the box's own run.
.It Cm status
Tools, VM, boot daemon, both apps and the newest backup pulled.
.It Cm local
The tool and runtime checks on this Mac, with no SSH.
.El
.Sh SUDO OVER SSH
Steps that need root take the box's password from the vault on stdin once per
shell
.Pq Li sudo -S -v ,
then call
.Li sudo -n .
A child process cannot see that grant, so the tool runs the steps itself
rather than through a command that calls sudo on its own.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.sage-is/boxes/<box>.env" -compact
.It Pa ~/.sage-is/boxes/<box>.env
The box file, mode 600.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/is.sage.box-backup-<box>.plist
The nightly pull on this Mac.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr sage-runtime 1 ,
.Xr sage-secret 1 ,
.Xr trellis-crm 1
